sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant LMS as LMS (LTI Platform)
participant LTIGW as LTI Gateway
participant OIDC as OidcController
participant TVS as TokenValidationService
participant OIDCProv as OIDC Provider
participant LS as LaunchService
participant Redis as Redis Cache
participant NRPS as NrpsService

LMS->>LTIGW: Initiate Login Request (OIDC Auth)
LTIGW->>OIDC: Forward Login Request
OIDC->>TVS: Validate State + Nonce
TVS->>OIDCProv: Retrieve OIDC Keys (JWKS)
OIDCProv-->>TVS: Return Public Keys
TVS-->>OIDC: Token Valid
OIDC-->>LMS: Redirect with ID Token & Auth Code

LMS->>LTIGW: LTI Launch Request (JWT + Claims)
LTIGW->>LS: Forward Launch Request
LS->>TVS: Validate Launch JWT & Signature
TVS->>OIDCProv: Verify Issuer + Keys
OIDCProv-->>TVS: Valid Issuer/Keys
TVS-->>LS: Claims Verified

LS->>Redis: Cache Launch Context (Roles, Course, User)
LS->>NRPS: Request Roles & Roster
NRPS->>LMS: Fetch Names & Roles
LMS-->>NRPS: Return Roster
NRPS-->>LS: Roster Synced

LS-->>LTIGW: Launch Success Response
LTIGW-->>LMS: Display Tool Content
